      "message": "Hi Vincent-\n\nI just wanted to update you on the delays we were able to reproduce with pause, vs isolation, and where we think those delays are getting introduced.\n\nWhile I have further analysis to complete on the 1000x thermal cases, the below was done with our 100x pause stress test case (100x meaning taking ~100x times as long to pause vs isolate).\n\nAny suggestions you have or proposals to deal with this, are appreciated.\n\nSincerely,\nStephen Dickey\n",
